:''For the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] counterpart, see [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Child of Destiny Phono''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] gacha event. They were added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]]. Similar to most other UBERFEST exclusives, Child of Destiny Phono has very different stats between forms, providing different usage in various situations.

